        "description": "App distribution status list. Use commas (,) to separate multiple records. -999: reviewing -995: updating 0: rejected 1: removed (including forcible removal) 62: releasing 101: released (including update and removal failure scenarios) 99999: removal applied 9998: draft 9997: deleted",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "appId": {
        "description": "List of app IDs to be queried. Use commas (,) to separate multiple IDs. Either appId or packageNames must be passed. If both of them are passed, appId is used.",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "appType": {
        "description": "App type. 1: mobile app (including common apps and games) 2: Vision app 4: router app 8: VR gadget app 9: watch app 19: quick app 23: Vision quick app 27: head unit app 28: head unit quick app 29: sports watch app 30: cloud game 9998: iOS app 9999: web app",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "fromRecCount": {
        "description": "Start page number. The value is a positive integer, which indicates an order in a list. If no value is passed, the default value 1 is used.",
